  "keyFeatures": [
    "Physics-based simulation of LEGO brick assembly and disassembly on NVIDIA Isaac Sim",
    "Automatic stud-hole connection detection with configurable force and alignment thresholds",
    "Physics-based breakage detection with clutch-compliance model",
    "Isaac Lab RL environment (AssembleBrick) with state, RGB, and RGB-D observation modes",
    "Topology JSON format for representing multi-brick assemblies and pose hints",
    "Multi-format structure import: BrickSim topology JSON, legolization JSON, StableText2Brick",
    "Part arrangement utilities for workspace layout planning",
    "StableLego static stability analysis via Gurobi MIP solver",
    "Expert policy rollout CLI with camera capture support",
    "Bundled BrickSim structures dataset with 1,000+ LEGO models"
  ],
